      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier and felt this crazy sharp snap in my lower back. now it’s super painful and i’m getting these weird shooting pains going all the way down my right leg. my foot even feels a bit heavy/weak when i try to walk. do u think i should try some deep stretches or maybe try to crack my back to get it back in place? i just feel like something is stuck or misaligned.",
